                                "sense_id": "b90a4794-1ddf-3f77-9f99-5ee40f5eccb1",
                                "text": "“That’s a bit like asking a man to subject himself to his own Freudian analysis,” he said, and then ventured this answer: “I guess I am Lear and the kitchen is my heath, wherein I strive to outscorn the to-and-fro conflicting wind and rain.”"
